1
00:01:21,360 --> 00:01:22,200
It's worth it.

2
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:25,160
When you have nothing,

3
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:26,560
worthiness is not even worth

4
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:29,480
the dust on the scale.

5
00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:32,200
Do you want to hear the story later?

6
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:35,680
Later,

7
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:38,760
the devil gave me a pair of scissors,

8
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:43,720
and I turned it into a wedding dress.

9
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:47,480
Ignore the latecomers and absentees.

10
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:48,400
Let's have a meeting.

11
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:50,480
I believe everyone has seen the news.

12
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:52,480
I won't introduce myself.

13
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,280
I guess none of you here

14
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:56,080
welcomes my arrival as an outsider.

15
00:01:56,440 --> 00:01:57,360
But it doesn't matter.

16
00:01:57,520 --> 00:01:59,320
Because I don't need any of you to change.

17
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:01,280
But you have to learn to accept.

18
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:03,840
Unless you choose to withdraw from the Dark Fairy Tale project.

19
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:14,080
Dark Fairy Tale

20
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:16,880
a key project to enter the luxury market.

21
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,520
In the subsequent work,

22
00:02:18,600 --> 00:02:20,760
I hope everyone here takes it seriously.

23
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,240
First,

24
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:24,880
let me tell you

25
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:26,800
the design concept of Dark Fairy Tale.

26
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:28,360
Dark Fairy Tale Series...

27
00:02:39,640 --> 00:02:40,560
Get up.

28
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,360
Dear,

29
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:49,360
that champagne last night

30
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:51,640
ruined my mascara.

31
00:02:52,760 --> 00:02:53,480
What are you doing?

32
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:54,800
Don't you see I'm busy?

33
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:58,200
My God!

34
00:02:58,560 --> 00:02:59,400
Why are you staring at me?

35
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:00,720
You scared me to death.

36
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:03,920
Your makeup is cakey.

37
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,840
Really?

38
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:21,360
Chief designer of women's wear,

39
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,960
Jiang Datong.

40
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:25,760
Calling someone by their full name is really rude.

41
00:03:26,040 --> 00:03:27,120
My name is Jeneri.

42
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:27,960
Jiang...

43
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:32,720
Being late for a meeting and ignoring the speaker is not rude?

44
00:03:32,880 --> 00:03:34,840
If it weren't for Young Master,

45
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:36,800
who would want to listen to

46
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,480
your lecture at night?

47
00:03:38,640 --> 00:03:40,360
No one forces you to join the Dark Fairy Tale.

48
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:43,320
I'm afraid you'll design something strange

49
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:44,880
and ruin our company's reputation.

50
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:48,040
Let's continue.

51
00:03:49,600 --> 00:03:50,840
The Dark Fairy Tale series

52
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:52,920
will use a subversive aesthetic perspective

53
00:03:52,920 --> 00:03:54,800
to analyze the pure appearance of traditional culture.

54
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:56,840
We will use luxurious fabrics and darkness...

55
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:59,160
Oh my god.

56
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:01,160
You don't understand women at all.

57
00:04:01,320 --> 00:04:03,200
Women are like crystals,

58
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:04,760
like princesses in fairy tales.

59
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,200
After experiencing darkness,

60
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:06,680
finally...

61
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:07,240
Get out.

62
00:04:09,200 --> 00:04:10,200
You're yelling at me?

63
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:12,600
Even the chairman and the young master never yelled at me.

64
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:15,600
You're just the young master's token fiancée.

65
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:16,280
You...

66
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:17,120
How dare you yell at me!

67
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,640
Do you need Lu Xu to kick you out?

68
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:28,920
Humph!

69
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:40,920
I'm watching you.

70
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:51,360
What's wrong with you?

71
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,440
You look upset.

72
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:56,320
Come on, try this.

73
00:04:57,200 --> 00:04:58,920
It was just air-freighted from Naples.

74
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,480
It's said to be this year's champion bean.

75
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:02,600
I've been busy with work lately.

76
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:03,920
I wanna come here to have a rest.

77
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:05,520
If you have something to do, just leave.

78
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:06,520
Well,

79
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:09,320
as long as I don't meet a difficult client like Lu Qianqian,

80
00:05:09,320 --> 00:05:10,840
I'm not that busy.

81
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:11,680
Li.

82
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:15,480
Miss Lu.

83
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:16,240
You...

84
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,320
Why are you here suddenly?

85
00:05:17,520 --> 00:05:18,480
I'll make you a cup of coffee.

86
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,680
Don't bother.

87
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:20,800
We're old friends.

88
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:21,720
Don't be so formal.

89
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:22,400
Have a seat.

90
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:28,440
Sun,

91
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:30,200
get Ms. Lu a glass of lemon water.

92
00:05:30,640 --> 00:05:30,840
Okay.

93
00:05:30,840 --> 00:05:31,760
I bought this for you.

94
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:32,480
This scent

95
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:33,840
suits you perfectly.

96
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,920
The latest Hermes bag

97
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:40,440
goes perfectly with your

98
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:41,800
will be a perfect match.

99
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:46,520
How did you know I was here?

100
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:47,960
Xiaorou told me.

101
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:50,480
She said you've been coming here often.

102
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:51,280
I thought

103
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:52,640
I'd come here to take a chance.

104
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:53,960
I didn't expect

105
00:05:53,960 --> 00:05:54,880
to actually find you.

106
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:55,480
Xiaorou

107
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:56,840
is really thoughtful.

108
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:57,720
Well,

109
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:59,320
I heard about it from my colleagues.

110
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:00,960
If you don't need anything,

111
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:02,080
I'll go back to the company.

112
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:02,320
OK.

113
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:04,640
Xiaorou,

114
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:07,720
the Bvlgari Rotating bracelet on your wrist

115
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:08,520
is very beautiful.

116
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:21,120
Why are you looking at me?

117
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:22,560
Do I have a flower on my face?

118
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:24,080
Qianqian, you look different today.

119
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:31,120
Let me share with you

120
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,520
some private thoughts

121
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:33,960
of a married woman.

122
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,240
My brother-in-law has been

123
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,520
doing quite well lately.

124
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:41,360
So it's about this kind of thing.

125
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:43,560
You're not married yet,

126
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:44,600
so you don't understand.

127
00:06:45,080 --> 00:06:46,280
This is

128
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,640
not a trivial matter.

129
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,240
After getting married,

130
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:49,880
love

131
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:52,000
gradually turns into family affection.

132
00:06:52,400 --> 00:06:54,320
Especially after having children,

133
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:56,360
the passion

134
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:58,200
is as flat as boiled water.

135
00:06:58,560 --> 00:06:59,280
In the past two years,

136
00:06:59,400 --> 00:07:01,880
I've been the one to initiate it eight out of ten times.

137
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:03,680
He even dares to reject me.

138
00:07:05,440 --> 00:07:07,040
But recently,

139
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,880
he's been acting differently.

140
00:07:09,400 --> 00:07:10,560
He's been very passionate.

141
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,200
It's like

142
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:14,080
the time before we got married,

143
00:07:14,280 --> 00:07:15,960
before I got pregnant.

144
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:19,160
Were you and Mr. Zhou not getting along well?

145
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:21,680
It's not like that.

146
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,040
It's just that recently,

147
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:24,720
when he comes back from business trips,

148
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:26,280
he's been very passionate.

149
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:28,440
Usually,

150
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:30,600
he's just so-so.

151
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:33,880
Sis,

152
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:35,520
why are you frowning?

153
00:07:35,840 --> 00:07:37,280
Oh, nothing.

154
00:07:37,280 --> 00:07:39,520
I just thought of my cheating ex-husband.

155
00:07:40,080 --> 00:07:41,040
You've been divorced?

156
00:07:41,320 --> 00:07:42,360
I never heard you mention it.

157
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:44,000
You've been abroad all the time.

158
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:45,360
Of course, you wouldn't know.

159
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:47,440
I got divorced because of my ex-husband's cheating.

160
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:49,440
Our married life

161
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:51,000
wasn't harmonious.

162
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:53,240
He was only passionate

163
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:54,280
when he came back from business trips.

164
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:57,520
Later, I read a book on psychology.

165
00:07:57,840 --> 00:07:59,360
It said that men who have cheated

166
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,240
would feel guilty.

167
00:08:00,880 --> 00:08:02,680
To cover up their affairs,

168
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:05,360
they would suddenly be very passionate towards their wives,

169
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:07,480
using this as a form of compensation.

170
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:08,680
Until...

171
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:11,720
You don't have to say anything.

172
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:13,760
No one thinks you're a mute.

173
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:15,320
I'm sorry.

174
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:15,760
I...

175
00:08:15,840 --> 00:08:16,920
I'll go tidy up a bit.

176
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:26,960
This place is really unlucky.

177
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,160
Let's go somewhere else.

178
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:29,440
I'm hungry.

179
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:47,800
What's the name of that cello piece

180
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:49,560
the cello piece

181
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:52,080
you played today?

182
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:54,440
It sounds familiar.

183
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,080
Zhou Jian,

184
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:57,560
I'll teach you a song.

185
00:08:58,560 --> 00:08:59,760
It's my favorite.

186
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:05,040
Do you love Lu Qianqian?

187
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:07,240
I...

188
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,640
I like you.

189
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:13,240
I know you like me, too.

190
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:15,240
I know you

191
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:17,560
as well as I know myself.

192
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:20,480
We both live in disguise.

193
00:09:22,040 --> 00:09:24,040
We resort to all means for a dark future.

194
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,640
Zhou Jian,

195
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:49,040
do you love me?

196
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:51,000
As long as you love me,

197
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:53,440
I will be the happiest woman in the world.

198
00:10:03,680 --> 00:10:04,680
Zhou Jian,

199
00:10:06,680 --> 00:10:07,840
do you love me?

200
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:13,760
I should go back.

201
00:10:24,760 --> 00:10:25,760
Are you scared?

202
00:11:05,880 --> 00:11:06,240
Hello?

203
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:07,280
What's up?

204
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:08,640
Mr. Zhou,

205
00:11:08,920 --> 00:11:10,440
the proposal for limited edition of Dark Fairy Tale

206
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:11,680
was rejected by the board.

207
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:12,920
Rejected?

208
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,720
Wasn't it approved before?

209
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:16,840
I don't know.

210
00:11:17,040 --> 00:11:18,800
And Mr. Zhuang also voted against it.

211
00:11:42,160 --> 00:11:43,280
Answer the phone.

212
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:45,840
[You must be curious now.]

213
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,600
[Let me tell you]

214
00:11:48,240 --> 00:11:50,560
[why the company rejected your proposal.]

215
00:11:58,600 --> 00:11:59,440
You did this?

216
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:01,960
Why?

217
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:04,240
I'm happy to see you upset.

218
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:12,000
Limited release is the key strategy

219
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:14,040
to quickly transform the company.

220
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:15,040
Do you understand?

221
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:16,640
So what?

222
00:12:17,040 --> 00:12:18,360
So your mischief must have limits.

223
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:19,440
Mischief?

224
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:21,560
Zhou Jian,

225
00:12:22,040 --> 00:12:23,280
what do you want to do

226
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:24,160
after the rapid transformation?

227
00:12:24,760 --> 00:12:25,760
Go public?

228
00:12:26,520 --> 00:12:28,360
You want to take Golden Thread public so soon.

229
00:12:28,480 --> 00:12:29,680
Is it for the company

230
00:12:29,880 --> 00:12:30,920
or

231
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:33,280
for yourself?

232
00:12:36,160 --> 00:12:38,320
You've used up all your luck

233
00:12:39,040 --> 00:12:41,480
to marry into the Lu family.

234
00:12:42,520 --> 00:12:43,640
Some things

235
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:46,800
are not for someone like you.

236
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:49,560
A second marriage son-in-law.

237
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:51,240
I'm telling you,

238
00:12:51,640 --> 00:12:53,640
no matter how much my sister likes you,

239
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:56,880
you'll always be a dog of the Lu family.

240
00:12:57,720 --> 00:12:58,720
Shut up!

241
00:12:59,640 --> 00:13:01,360
Don't talk to me like that.

242
00:13:01,680 --> 00:13:02,480
Do you hear me?

243
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:06,120
You can't talk to me like this.

244
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:21,760
Why are you here?

245
00:13:23,560 --> 00:13:24,360
Uncle.

246
00:13:24,920 --> 00:13:25,440
Mumu.

247
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:27,040
You've grown taller.

248
00:13:27,760 --> 00:13:28,640
Do you miss me?

249
00:13:28,640 --> 00:13:29,240
Yes.

250
00:13:29,240 --> 00:13:30,520
Did you bring toys?

251
00:13:30,520 --> 00:13:31,400
Of course.

252
00:13:31,800 --> 00:13:33,440
I brought your favorite toy.

253
00:13:33,640 --> 00:13:34,080
Come here.

254
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:35,000
Let me hold you.

255
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:37,760
You've grown heavier.

256
00:13:45,040 --> 00:13:45,880
Sis,

257
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:49,120
this is my home too, isn't it?

258
00:13:51,120 --> 00:13:51,920
Yan,

259
00:13:52,920 --> 00:13:54,160
prepare a room for me.

260
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:55,800
Starting today,

261
00:13:56,400 --> 00:13:58,040
I'm moving back to the Lu family mansion.

262
00:14:18,800 --> 00:14:19,480
Mr. Zhuang,

263
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:22,840
I didn't expect you and the other shareholders

264
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:24,720
to reject Zhou Jian's proposal together.

265
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:27,560
Isn't it more in your interest

266
00:14:27,680 --> 00:14:29,440
Release Dark Fairy Tale limitedly to open the market.

267
00:14:29,960 --> 00:14:32,160
After all, Golden Thread is surnamed Lu, not Zhuang.

268
00:14:32,600 --> 00:14:34,280
I'm just going with the flow.

269
00:14:35,080 --> 00:14:35,600
Ah,

270
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:40,040
your chess skills are truly becoming unpredictable.

271
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:46,080
Mr. Liu, you're too kind.

272
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:48,240
If you hadn't gone easy on me,

273
00:14:48,560 --> 00:14:49,720
how could I have won?

274
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:52,200
I gave it my all this time.

275
00:14:52,520 --> 00:14:53,560
Especially this move.

276
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:55,200
It's perfectly balanced.

277
00:14:55,480 --> 00:14:56,560
Ingenious.

278
00:14:57,160 --> 00:14:58,280
I lost by five and a half points.

279
00:14:58,280 --> 00:14:59,640
I'm completely convinced.
